    {"id": "butterworth.bandpass_1_by_hand", "op": "butterworth_bandpass", "args": {"order": 1, "low": 1.0, "high": 3.0, "sample_rate": 8.0}, "expected": [[0.5, 0.0, -0.5, 1.0, 0.0, 0.0]], "tol": {"abs": 1e-12, "rel": 1e-12}, "source": "by hand: tan(pi/8) tan(3 pi/8) = 1 and tan(3 pi/8) - tan(pi/8) = 2, so the analog section is 2s/(s^2 + 2s + 1); with s = (1 - z^-1)/(1 + z^-1) that is 2(1 - z^-2)/4"},
    {"id": "butterworth.bandstop_1_by_hand", "op": "butterworth_bandstop", "args": {"order": 1, "low": 1.0, "high": 3.0, "sample_rate": 8.0}, "expected": [[0.5, 0.0, 0.5, 1.0, 0.0, 0.0]], "tol": {"abs": 1e-12, "rel": 1e-12}, "source": "by hand: as bandpass_1_by_hand, the analog section (s^2 + 1)/(s^2 + 2s + 1) is (2 + 2 z^-2)/4"},
